    },
    {
      "title": "Confrontation with the prophet Micaiah",
      "description": "When the true prophet Micaiah, son of Imlah, prophesied defeat for Ahab, Zedekiah struck him on the cheek and challenged him by asking how the Spirit of the Lord had gone from him to Micaiah.",
