    {
      "title": "Ahab's defeat and death confirm the false prophecy",
      "description": "Ahab went to war against Ramoth in Gilead based on the advice of the false prophets, including Zedekiah, but was mortally wounded in battle – confirming that Micaiah had spoken truth and Zedekiah had prophesied lies.",
